# ==============================================================================
# LAMP Edge Computing Research Project — .gitignore
# ==============================================================================
# This repository archives the complete experimental reproduction, empirical
# benchmarks, and formal research reports for the LAMP Edge Computing study.
#
# Heavy external execution runtimes (iFogSim2 framework and Eclipse IDE) are
# excluded and must be acquired separately per their respective open-source
# distributions. All datasets, raw simulation logs, analytical scripts,
# figures, validation records, and manuscript deliverables are tracked.
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. External Simulator & IDE Runtimes (Obtain Separately)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
iFogSim-main/
eclipse-java-2025-03-R-win32-x86_64/
.metadata/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Java Compiled Bytecode & Build Artifacts
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.class
bin/
build/
target/
*.jar
*.war
*.ear

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. IDE, Editor, & Toolchain Configurations
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.classpath
.project
.settings/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. Python Bytecode, Caches, & Virtual Environments
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
venv/
.env
.venv/
env/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. OS-Generated Files, System Clutter, & Editor Swaps
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
*.swo
*~
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 6. Scratch & Reproducible Visual Inspection Renders
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Intermediate workspace scratch files
scratch/

# Intermediate visual audit inspection page renders (reproducible from PDFs)
ieee_paper/rendered_pages/
ieee_paper/rendered_revised_pages/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 7. Explicit Retention Safeguards (Preserve Research Deliverables)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Ensure results, demonstrations, and figures are never inadvertently excluded
!results/
!results/**
!demonstration_results/
!demonstration_results/**
!ieee_paper/figures/
!ieee_paper/figures/**
!PHASE_3_5_CODE_REVIEW.zip
